sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant W as Web app
  participant S as Vouch API
  participant D as MongoDB / GridFS
  participant C as Smart contract
  U->>W: Add files, photo, voice or link
  W->>S: POST /api/docs/notarize (JWT, items, capture context)
  S->>S: Fetch link safely (SSRF checks), hash each item (SHA-256)
  S->>C: verify(hash): already registered?
  C-->>S: not found
  S->>S: Analyse metadata, snapshot (GPS coordinates removed)
  S->>D: Store file (GridFS) + record
  S->>C: notarize(hash, userRef) via relayer wallet
  C-->>S: tx receipt (block number, block timestamp)
  S->>D: Save tx hash, timestamp, capture context
  S->>S: Append to hash-chained audit log
  S-->>W: Result per item
  W-->>U: Notarized + certificate with QR
